"""PostgreSQL persistence for authorization and narrow durable execution.

The adapter exposes narrow repositories and never exposes a raw SQLAlchemy
session to application code. Durable execution accepts only the synthetic
unfilled-expiration, strict-partial-fill/cancellation, and exact rule-bound
NO or contract-specific VOID settlement lifecycles.
"""

